Compliance note
---------------
XinMatch is an independent clean-room implementation. It does not contain any
code, binary, or proprietary database extracted from Match! (Crystal Impact).
All specifications are derived from publicly available documentation, published
scientific algorithms, and black-box observation of file formats for
interoperability. See ``docs/00_TECH_STACK_ANALYSIS.md`` for the full
compliance boundary.
